# Monthly cron job for RPPS data update
# Install with: crontab /path/to/rpps-neuro-app/scripts/cron_monthly
#
# Run on 6th of each month at 2:00 AM (after data.gouv.fr updates)
# The script writes its own log to logs/monthly_update.log : no >> needed.
#
# On Windows, run it under Git Bash via the Windows Task Scheduler instead:
#   Program   : C:\Program Files\Git\bin\bash.exe
#   Arguments : -lc "cd /g/Neuro-liste/rpps-neuro-app && bash scripts/monthly_update.sh"
#   Trigger   : day 6 of each month at 02:00
0 2 6 * * cd /path/to/rpps-neuro-app && bash scripts/monthly_update.sh